    "title": "Contact Us",
    "content_html": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Getaways El Salvador, we’re here to help make your stay in El Zonte seamless — whether you’re planning a surf getaway, looking for a longer stay, or exploring rental management opportunities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For booking inquiries, property management information, or general questions, feel free to reach out to us directly:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>📩 <strong>Email:</strong> <a>getaways@goodlifeelsalvador.com</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’ll be happy to assist you and help you plan your stay on El Salvador’s beautiful Pacific coast.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/contact-form {\"jetpackCRM\":false,\"variationName\":\"default\",\"salesforceData\":{\"organizationId\":\"\",\"sendToSalesforce\":false},\"mailpoet\":{\"listId\":null,\"listName\":null,\"enabledForForm\":false},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"left\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-contact-form\"><!-- wp:jetpack/field-name {\"required\":true,\"fieldVariant\":\"name\"} -->\n<div><!-- wp:jetpack/label {\"label\":\"Name\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/input /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:jetpack/field-name -->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/field-email {\"required\":true} -->\n<div><!-- wp:jetpack/label {\"label\":\"Email\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/input /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:jetpack/field-email -->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/field-textarea -->\n<div><!-- wp:jetpack/label {\"label\":\"Message\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/input {\"type\":\"textarea\"} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:jetpack/field-textarea -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"tagName\":\"button\",\"type\":\"submit\",\"lock\":{\"move\":false,\"remove\":true}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Contact us</button></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:jetpack/contact-form -->",
